### Analyze a migration (database-aware demo)
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "ALTER TABLE Customers ALTER COLUMN Email VARCHAR(50) NOT NULL;",
  "scriptName": "narrow.sql"
}

### Analyze a destructive migration
POST {{server_HostAddress}}/api/analysis
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "script": "DROP TABLE Customers;",
  "scriptName": "drop.sql"
}

